@page "/api"

<PageTitle>API Guide ? ExLlamaSharp</PageTitle>

<PageHeader Title="API Guide" Subtitle="OpenAI-compatible /v1 and admin /api/v1 ? Bearer API key (admin scope for /api/v1)." />

<div class="card card-outline card-primary card-table mb-3">
    <div class="card-header"><h3 class="card-title"><i class="fas fa-plug mr-2"></i>OpenAI-compatible (<code>/v1</code>)</h3></div>
    <div class="card-body">
        <div class="kx-table-wrap">
            <table class="table-clean">
                <thead>
                    <tr><th>Method</th><th>Path</th><th>Notes</th></tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr><td>POST</td><td><code>/v1/chat/completions</code></td><td>Chat; supports <code>stream</code>, tools, multimodal</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>POST</td><td><code>/v1/completions</code></td><td>Text completions</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>POST</td><td><code>/v1/embeddings</code></td><td>Embeddings</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>POST</td><td><code>/v1/tokenize</code></td><td>Tokenize text</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>POST</td><td><code>/v1/detokenize</code></td><td>Detokenize ids</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>GET</td><td><code>/v1/models</code></td><td>List models</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>GET</td><td><code>/v1/models/{id}</code></td><td>Model details</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>GET</td><td><code>/v1/metrics</code></td><td>JSON engine metrics</td></tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
        <p class="mb-0 mt-3 small text-muted">
            Ollama-style extras under <code>options</code>
            (<span class="kx-chip-row" style="display:inline-flex;margin:0 0.25rem">
                <span class="kx-chip kx-chip-muted">num_predict</span>
                <span class="kx-chip kx-chip-muted">num_ctx</span>
                <span class="kx-chip kx-chip-muted">top_k</span>
                <span class="kx-chip kx-chip-muted">min_p</span>
                <span class="kx-chip kx-chip-muted">repeat_penalty</span>
            </span>
            ? OpenAI fields win when both are set. No separate Ollama <code>/api/chat</code> server.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card card-outline card-secondary card-table mb-3">
    <div class="card-header"><h3 class="card-title"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt mr-2"></i>Admin (<code>/api/v1</code>)</h3></div>
    <div class="card-body">
        <div class="kx-table-wrap">
            <table class="table-clean">
                <thead>
                    <tr><th>Area</th><th>Endpoints</th></tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Settings</td>
                        <td><code>GET/POST/PATCH /settings</code></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Models</td>
                        <td>
                            <div class="kx-chip-row mb-0">
                                <span class="kx-chip kx-chip-muted">GET /models/library</span>
                                <span class="kx-chip kx-chip-muted">GET ?/search</span>
                                <span class="kx-chip kx-chip-muted">POST load|unload|pull|quantize|import|alias</span>
                                <span class="kx-chip kx-chip-muted">GET/PUT ?/modelfile</span>
                                <span class="kx-chip kx-chip-muted">GET /models/jobs/{id}</span>
                            </div>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Jobs</td>
                        <td><code>GET /jobs</code>, <code>POST /jobs/{id}/cancel</code></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Keys</td>
                        <td><code>GET/POST /keys</code>, <code>DELETE /keys/{id}</code></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Users</td>
                        <td><code>GET/POST /users</code>, <code>PATCH/DELETE /users/{id}</code></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Moderation</td>
                        <td><code>GET/POST /moderation/rules</code>, <code>DELETE ?/{id}</code></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Backup</td>
                        <td><code>POST /backup</code>, <code>POST /backup/restore</code>, <code>POST /restart</code></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>A/B</td>
                        <td><code>GET/POST /ab</code>, <code>GET /ab/{id}</code>, <code>POST /ab/vote</code></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Tenants</td>
                        <td><code>GET/POST /tenants</code>, <code>GET /tenants/{id}</code></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Adapters</td>
                        <td><code>GET/POST /adapters</code>, <code>GET/DELETE /adapters/{id}</code></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Other</td>
                        <td><code>GET /about</code>, <code>GET /logs/stream</code> (SSE)</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card card-outline card-secondary">
    <div class="card-header"><h3 class="card-title"><i class="fas fa-heartbeat mr-2"></i>Ops (no API key)</h3></div>
    <div class="card-body">
        <div class="kx-chip-row mb-0">
            <span class="kx-chip">GET /health</span>
            <span class="kx-chip">GET /ready</span>
            <span class="kx-chip">GET /metrics</span>
        </div>
        <p class="form-text mt-3 mb-0">Live dashboard: SignalR <code>/hubs/dashboard</code> (<code>metrics</code>).</p>
    </div>
</div>
